{"id":"0d1c099bf76b43d1","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-dependency-pair.md","title":"df-dependency-pair","display":"df-dependency-pair","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-dependency-pair","aliases":["56-df-dependency-pair"],"display":"df-dependency-pair","type":"definition","depends_on":["[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","[[56-df-position]]","[[56-df-subterm]]"],"source_section":"6.5.44(i)–(ii)","source_pages":"250–251","source_ocr_blocks":[271,272],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-dependency-pair"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-dependency-pair</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dependency-pair"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.5.44(i)–(ii)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"250–251"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>271</span><span>272</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span> 取互异且不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\cup V\">\\(F\\cup V\\)</span> 的新符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^\\#\">\\(f^\\#\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^\\#=\\{f^\\#\\mid f\\in F\\}\">\\(F^\\#=\\{f^\\#\\mid f\\in F\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^\\#=(F\\cup F^\\#,\\mathrm{ar}^\\#)\">\\(\\Sigma^\\#=(F\\cup F^\\#,\\mathrm{ar}^\\#)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}^\\#|_F=\\mathrm{ar}\">\\(\\mathrm{ar}^\\#|_F=\\mathrm{ar}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}^\\#(f^\\#)=\\mathrm{ar}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{ar}^\\#(f^\\#)=\\mathrm{ar}(f)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t|_p\">\\(t|_p\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pos}(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{Pos}(t)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a>；非变量项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\vec t)\">\\(f(\\vec t)\\)</span> 的根为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Def}_R&amp;:=\\{f\\in F\\mid\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\;\\exists\\vec l\\in T^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}\\;l=f(\\vec l)\\},\\\\\n\\bigl(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\bigr)^\\#&amp;:=f^\\#(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\quad(f\\in\\mathrm{Def}_R),\\\\\n\\mathrm{DP}(\\Sigma,V,R)&amp;:=\\{(l^\\#,(r|_p)^\\#)\\mid\n(l,r)\\in R,\\;p\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(r),\\;r|_p\\notin V,\\;\n\\mathrm{root}(r|_p)\\in\\mathrm{Def}_R\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Def}_R&amp;:=\\{f\\in F\\mid\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\;\\exists\\vec l\\in T^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}\\;l=f(\\vec l)\\},\\\\\n\\bigl(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\bigr)^\\#&amp;:=f^\\#(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\quad(f\\in\\mathrm{Def}_R),\\\\\n\\mathrm{DP}(\\Sigma,V,R)&amp;:=\\{(l^\\#,(r|_p)^\\#)\\mid\n(l,r)\\in R,\\;p\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(r),\\;r|_p\\notin V,\\;\n\\mathrm{root}(r|_p)\\in\\mathrm{Def}_R\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Definition 6.5.44(i)–(ii)（印刷 pp.250–251）。只标记一项的根，参数保持原样；这不是把所有内部 defined symbols 同时大写。依赖对是有向有序项对，不是临界对，因此已解除旧稿错误依赖 critical-pair。为简化签名接口预先为全部 F 选新符号，实际依赖对只使用 defined symbols 的标记。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.5.44(i)–(ii)，印刷页 250–251。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本层提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-subterm]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，$\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$。对每个 $f\\in F$ 取互异且不属于 $F\\cup V$ 的新符号 $f^\\#$，令 $F^\\#=\\{f^\\#\\mid f\\in F\\}$，$\\Sigma^\\#=(F\\cup F^\\#,\\mathrm{ar}^\\#)$，其中 $\\mathrm{ar}^\\#|_F=\\mathrm{ar}$，$\\mathrm{ar}^\\#(f^\\#)=\\mathrm{ar}(f)$。$t|_p$、$\\mathrm{Pos}(t)$ 见 [[56-df-position]]；非变量项 $f(\\vec t)$ 的根为 $f$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"F\\cup V","display":false},{"tex":"f^\\#","display":false},{"tex":"F^\\#=\\{f^\\#\\mid f\\in F\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^\\#=(F\\cup F^\\#,\\mathrm{ar}^\\#)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ar}^\\#|_F=\\mathrm{ar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ar}^\\#(f^\\#)=\\mathrm{ar}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"t|_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pos}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\vec t)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Def}_R&:=\\{f\\in F\\mid\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\;\\exists\\vec l\\in T^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}\\;l=f(\\vec l)\\},\\\\\n\\bigl(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\bigr)^\\#&:=f^\\#(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\quad(f\\in\\mathrm{Def}_R),\\\\\n\\mathrm{DP}(\\Sigma,V,R)&:=\\{(l^\\#,(r|_p)^\\#)\\mid\n(l,r)\\in R,\\;p\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(r),\\;r|_p\\notin V,\\;\n\\mathrm{root}(r|_p)\\in\\mathrm{Def}_R\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1905,"backlinks":[{"id":"6a7c74fcead3e2ed","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-dependency-pair]] 的 $\\Sigma,V,R,\\Sigma^\\#$；$T^\\#=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma^\\#,V)$。$\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma^\\#,V,R)$ 采用 [[56-df-signature-relative-rewrite]] 的显式签名接口；下式定义 $\\to_R^\\#$。关系的星闭包取 [[56-df-relation-closure]] 在载体 $T^\\#$ 上的构造。$D\\in\\mathrm{DP}(\\Sigma,V,R)^{\\mathbb N}$，写 $D_i=(s_i,t_i)$。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-234","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-dependency-pair.md]]"}],"outgoing":["a6c29a8d098ef0ed","da02033e6d596cae","c3157a722a0edf96"]}